  "prefLabel": "Plc 1801.04 Definitions Incorporated",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1801.04 Definitions Incorporated.\n\n(a) The definitions of terms in Plc 102 shall apply to this chapter.\n\n(b) All terms used in these rules relative to procedures, applications, inspections, and fees that are defined in Plc 200, Plc 300, Plc 400, or Plc 1000 shall have the meaning specified therein.\n\nSource. #14330, eff 9-22-25, EXPIRES: 9-22-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1800.html"
